  "description": "TREKKING KNOW-HOW BUILT ON EXPERIENCE. Trust in our experience. The X-LIFE bikes allow a relaxing ride so that you can enjoy nature. To enable maximum satisfaction, you only need to discover the right KTM trekking bike for your needs. For decades these bicycles have been at the forefront of people‘s minds when they think about trekking. All X-LIFE models are equipped with suspension fork and offer more grip than the on-road brothers. Integrated cable routing and a front reflector, incorporated into the fork bridge, ensure the bikes are capable and attractive. The tapered headtube increases the steerer tube stiffness. The X-LIFE TRACK STREET and X-LIFE ACTION STREET models are already equipped with lights and fenders. All other bikes can be upgraded when needed. Have fun on your next trip.",
